text.en:
Two concurrent assignments do it. The carry is generated when `a` and `b` agree, or when `cin` rides along with the half-sum:

```vhdl
sum  <= a xor b xor cin;
cout <= (a and b) or (cin and (a xor b));
```

text.es:
Con dos asignaciones concurrentes basta. El acarreo se genera cuando `a` y `b` coinciden, o cuando `cin` acompaña a la media suma:

```vhdl
sum  <= a xor b xor cin;
cout <= (a and b) or (cin and (a xor b));
```
